kidux-session (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: the machine boots into greetd on terminal 7, a child's
    session runs cage with the launcher in it, and the lock screen has a
    compositor and a logind session of its own on terminal 8.
  * Every door closed as a packaged file: no spare terminals and no text
    logins on them, no Ctrl+Alt+Delete, no SysRq, no ptrace between a
    child's processes, a child's processes ending with their session, the
    power key left to kidux-daemon, children refused SSH and everything in
    polkit except turning the computer off and mounting removable drives.
  * GRUB boots a Kidux entry straight through and keeps every other entry
    behind the recovery password.

 -- Antonio Morales García <info@kidux.org>  Tue, 22 Sep 2026 23:25:45 +0200
